WEBVTT

1
00:52:37.834 --> 00:52:40.834
We praise your name, for your name is holy.

2
00:52:40.834 --> 00:52:45.834
And there is literally ONLY ONE who deserves all this honor.

3
00:52:45.834 --> 00:52:47.834
There is only ONE.

4
00:52:47.834 --> 00:52:49.834
There is only ONE who has created everything.

5
00:52:49.834 --> 00:52:51.834
There is only ONE who completes everything.

6
00:52:51.834 --> 00:52:54.834
There is only ONE who has saved me.

7
00:52:54.834 --> 00:52:57.834
And so there is also only ONE who deserves all the honor.

8
00:52:57.834 --> 00:52:59.834
And his name is...

9
00:52:59.834 --> 00:53:00.834
ONE!

10
00:53:00.834 --> 00:53:01.834
That's it.

11
00:53:03.834 --> 00:53:04.834
That's it.

12
00:53:05.834 --> 00:53:08.834
No, okay. I just wanted to check if you understand.

13
00:53:10.834 --> 00:53:12.834
We praise your name. Ruben, may I invite you.

14
00:53:13.834 --> 00:53:16.834
This morning I sent a message to Ruben and I said...

15
00:53:16.834 --> 00:53:19.834
Ruben, would you teach us about the collection?

16
00:53:19.834 --> 00:53:20.834
And he said...

17
00:53:21.834 --> 00:53:22.834
Yes.

18
00:53:24.834 --> 00:53:25.834
He had no choice either.

19
00:53:25.834 --> 00:53:26.834
Yes he did.

20
00:53:26.834 --> 00:53:28.834
May I have a round of applause for Ruben?

21
00:53:28.834 --> 00:53:30.834
Because you know, this is worship.

22
00:53:30.834 --> 00:53:31.834
Hallelujah.

23
00:53:32.834 --> 00:53:33.834
Amen.

24
00:53:34.834 --> 00:53:35.834
Amen.

25
00:53:39.834 --> 00:53:40.834
Amen, amen, amen.

26
00:53:41.834 --> 00:53:43.834
I'm not used to it either, so...

27
00:53:43.834 --> 00:53:44.834
Please.

28
00:53:47.834 --> 00:53:50.834
Yes, we have already heard beautiful things today.

29
00:53:51.834 --> 00:53:56.834
And what I really had on my heart to share with you today...

30
00:53:57.834 --> 00:54:01.834
The text is normally on the screen now, I think.

31
00:54:02.834 --> 00:54:06.834
And it is a text from 2 Timothy, chapter 2, verse 13.

32
00:54:06.834 --> 00:54:07.834
And it says...

33
00:54:07.834 --> 00:54:12.834
But if we are unfaithful to him, he remains faithful to us.

34
00:54:12.834 --> 00:54:15.834
For he cannot be unfaithful to himself.

35
00:54:16.834 --> 00:54:18.834
And that requires...

36
00:54:19.834 --> 00:54:21.834
A change of thought.

37
00:54:21.834 --> 00:54:25.834
That requires something we do not understand well.

38
00:54:25.834 --> 00:54:27.834
As people, we often think that...

39
00:54:27.834 --> 00:54:29.834
We have to do something.

40
00:54:30.834 --> 00:54:32.834
We have to perform something.

41
00:54:34.834 --> 00:54:36.834
We must stand out for God.

42
00:54:37.834 --> 00:54:41.834
But you know, true faith is about what God did for us.

43
00:54:41.834 --> 00:54:43.834
And not what we can do for God.

44
00:54:44.834 --> 00:54:46.834
So if we talk about giving today...

45
00:54:47.834 --> 00:54:50.834
Then I actually want to say, give your life to Him.

46
00:54:51.834 --> 00:54:53.834
Because that is actually the most important thing.

47
00:54:53.834 --> 00:54:55.834
And whether you have been converted for a long time...

48
00:54:55.834 --> 00:54:56.834
Or for a short time...

49
00:54:57.834 --> 00:54:58.834
It doesn't matter.

50
00:54:59.834 --> 00:55:01.834
I know, what I am about to say...

51
00:55:01.834 --> 00:55:03.834
My wife doesn't like that.

52
00:55:04.834 --> 00:55:08.834
But I am intentionally looking that way to bring you all into the value.

53
00:55:10.834 --> 00:55:14.834
But she is the one who prayed for me when I was struggling.

54
00:55:15.834 --> 00:55:20.834
She is the one who wanted to return to God at one point.

55
00:55:21.834 --> 00:55:23.834
When I didn't even realize it yet.

56
00:55:23.834 --> 00:55:25.834
When I didn't even realize it yet.

57
00:55:25.834 --> 00:55:27.834
And she kept praying.

58
00:55:28.834 --> 00:55:29.834
And you know...

59
00:55:30.834 --> 00:55:32.834
I had a 22-year head start on her.

60
00:55:32.834 --> 00:55:36.834
Because I grew up in a Christian family from a young age.

61
00:55:37.834 --> 00:55:39.834
And she came to faith.

62
00:55:39.834 --> 00:55:41.834
And she knew who God was.

63
00:55:42.834 --> 00:55:44.834
Even though we are unfaithful...

64
00:55:44.834 --> 00:55:46.834
He remains faithful.

65
00:55:46.834 --> 00:55:47.834
Always.

66
00:55:48.834 --> 00:55:50.834
Much blessing with giving.

67
00:55:53.834 --> 00:55:55.834
Thank you.

68
00:56:23.834 --> 00:56:24.834
You are the Word.

69
00:56:25.834 --> 00:56:27.834
John had a revelation and he said...

70
00:56:27.834 --> 00:56:30.834
In the beginning was the Word.

71
00:56:30.834 --> 00:56:32.834
The Word was with God.

72
00:56:32.834 --> 00:56:34.834
And the Word was God.

73
00:56:34.834 --> 00:56:35.834
Is God.

74
00:56:35.834 --> 00:56:37.834
He is the Word.

75
00:56:37.834 --> 00:56:40.834
So when we hold on to the Word and when we teach the Word...

76
00:56:40.834 --> 00:56:44.834
And when we speak the Word and when we believe in the Word...

77
00:56:44.834 --> 00:56:47.834
We ultimately believe in Jesus.

78
00:56:48.834 --> 00:56:50.834
He is the beginning and the end.

79
00:56:51.834 --> 00:56:58.834
And so this part of the service, the teaching, part of the fivefold ministry...

80
00:56:58.834 --> 00:57:00.834
Is so important.

81
00:57:00.834 --> 00:57:03.834
For it teaches us namely...

82
00:57:04.834 --> 00:57:07.834
Who we actually are in Jesus.

83
00:57:07.834 --> 00:57:11.834
It teaches us actually who we are truly worshiping.

84
00:57:11.834 --> 00:57:15.834
It is very important that you receive good biblical teaching.

85
00:57:15.834 --> 00:57:20.834
Because otherwise you will go with a lack of information...

86
00:57:20.834 --> 00:57:22.834
Imagine a God.

87
00:57:22.834 --> 00:57:24.834
Do you understand what I mean?

88
00:57:24.834 --> 00:57:28.834
So it is important that you receive teaching from the Word of God...

89
00:57:28.834 --> 00:57:30.834
So that you know who God is.

90
00:57:30.834 --> 00:57:32.834
And what He has done.

91
00:57:32.834 --> 00:57:34.834
And what He especially does not want to do.

92
00:57:34.834 --> 00:57:36.834
And what He wants to prevent.

93
00:57:36.834 --> 00:57:38.834
And how He wants to shape us.

94
00:57:38.834 --> 00:57:43.834
So I bless us all in the name of Jesus with the words that I will soon speak.

95
00:57:44.834 --> 00:57:46.834
And I want to talk today...

96
00:57:47.834 --> 00:57:52.834
About what has become clear to us, Vanessa and me, and perhaps to the whole church...

97
00:57:52.834 --> 00:57:54.834
In the past ten days.

98
00:57:54.834 --> 00:57:58.834
And that is namely what God wants from His church at this moment.

99
00:57:58.834 --> 00:58:02.834
We had agreed on a theme for this year.

100
00:58:02.834 --> 00:58:04.834
And you do that in prayer.

101
00:58:04.834 --> 00:58:06.834
And in accordance with the Holy Spirit.

102
00:58:06.834 --> 00:58:09.834
And ultimately you come prophetically to a theme.

103
00:58:09.834 --> 00:58:11.834
And you then declare that over the church.

104
00:58:11.834 --> 00:58:14.834
And we have decided, just like last year.

105
00:58:14.834 --> 00:58:16.834
But this year we have done it again.

106
00:58:16.834 --> 00:58:21.834
That we have set aside a time of prayer and worship and fasting.

107
00:58:21.834 --> 00:58:23.834
To delve deeper into that.

108
00:58:23.834 --> 00:58:27.834
And then you let God or let the Holy Spirit speak through you.

109
00:58:27.834 --> 00:58:31.834
And I can only personally tell you...

110
00:58:32.834 --> 00:58:33.834
Wow.

111
00:58:35.834 --> 00:58:36.834
Wow.

112
00:58:37.834 --> 00:58:40.834
It was a wild ride.

113
00:58:42.834 --> 00:58:44.834
God is a good God.

114
00:58:45.834 --> 00:58:49.834
I repeat, God is a good God.

115
00:58:50.834 --> 00:58:52.834
And why do I repeat this?

116
00:58:52.834 --> 00:58:55.834
Because the words I am about to speak...

117
00:58:55.834 --> 00:59:04.834
Must be underscored by our faith that God is a good God.

118
00:59:06.834 --> 00:59:09.834
As you know, here I am.

119
00:59:09.834 --> 00:59:10.834
Send me.

120
00:59:10.834 --> 00:59:14.834
Are the words we have spoken about 2022.

121
00:59:14.834 --> 00:59:15.834
For the church.

122
00:59:16.834 --> 00:59:18.834
And not just open church.

123
00:59:18.834 --> 00:59:22.834
It is simply wonderful to see this reflected in different churches.

124
00:59:22.834 --> 00:59:25.834
Where Vanessa and I keep an eye on things a bit.

125
00:59:25.834 --> 00:59:29.834
And we also allow ourselves to be taught by certain things.

126
00:59:29.834 --> 00:59:33.834
But especially in your own prayer, you set this down somewhere in June.

127
00:59:33.834 --> 00:59:38.834
And then somewhere in December, you see that other churches are echoing that same message everywhere.

128
00:59:38.834 --> 00:59:40.834
And this corresponds with Scripture.

129
00:59:40.834 --> 00:59:43.834
For the Bible says there is only one spirit.

130
00:59:43.834 --> 00:59:46.834
So the church of Jesus Christ has one spirit.

131
00:59:46.834 --> 00:59:47.834
Has one language.

132
00:59:47.834 --> 00:59:49.834
And that is the language of love towards Jesus.

133
00:59:49.834 --> 00:59:50.834
That makes sense.

134
00:59:50.834 --> 00:59:56.834
And so it makes sense that you come to the same echo realizations.

135
00:59:56.834 --> 00:59:58.834
For we have only one church.

136
00:59:58.834 --> 00:59:59.834
And there is only one spirit.

137
00:59:59.834 --> 01:00:01.834
And we have only one Lord.

138
01:00:01.834 --> 01:00:02.834
And His name is Jesus.

139
01:00:02.834 --> 01:00:03.834
Amen.

140
01:00:05.834 --> 01:00:07.834
Here I am here.

141
01:00:07.834 --> 01:00:08.834
Send me.

142
01:00:09.834 --> 01:00:14.834
And in the past few weeks, I have read Isaiah chapter 6 several times.

143
01:00:14.834 --> 01:00:16.834
For the words here I am here.

144
01:00:16.834 --> 01:00:17.834
Send me.

145
01:00:17.834 --> 01:00:20.834
Comes from the chapter Isaiah chapter 6.

146
01:00:22.834 --> 01:00:25.834
And so I could read Isaiah chapter 6 once more.

147
01:00:25.834 --> 01:00:29.834
But then I am afraid at the end of such a fixed time.

148
01:00:29.834 --> 01:00:32.834
That you will soon start throwing stones like, hello.

149
01:00:33.834 --> 01:00:39.834
But what I do want to do is quote a number of verses from Isaiah chapter 6.

150
01:00:39.834 --> 01:00:43.834
Which I believe is important for me to teach today.

151
01:00:43.834 --> 01:00:47.834
And these are the verses 5 to 7.

152
01:00:47.834 --> 01:00:50.834
Read along with me or listen.

153
01:00:50.834 --> 01:00:52.834
And then I cried out.

154
01:00:52.834 --> 01:00:55.834
Help, I am going to die.

155
01:00:55.834 --> 01:00:59.834
For I am a man from whom no good word comes.

156
01:00:59.834 --> 01:01:03.834
And I belong to a people from whom no good word comes.

157
01:01:03.834 --> 01:01:05.834
And now I have seen the king.

158
01:01:05.834 --> 01:01:08.834
The Lord of hosts.

159
01:01:08.834 --> 01:01:10.834
But one of the angels flew to me.

160
01:01:10.834 --> 01:01:13.834
He had in his hand a tongs with a piece of glowing coal.

161
01:01:13.834 --> 01:01:16.834
That he had taken from the fire on the altar.

162
01:01:16.834 --> 01:01:19.834
He touched my mouth with the glowing coal.

163
01:01:19.834 --> 01:01:21.834
And then he said, pay attention.

164
01:01:21.834 --> 01:01:23.834
This coal has touched your mouth.

165
01:01:23.834 --> 01:01:27.834
Now your mouth and your heart have been cleansed by fire.

166
01:01:27.834 --> 01:01:30.834
Everything in which you have been disobedient to God.

167
01:01:30.834 --> 01:01:34.834
Has been removed and forgiven.

168
01:01:35.834 --> 01:01:37.834
Indeed, hallelujah.

169
01:01:37.834 --> 01:01:39.834
Everything.

170
01:01:40.834 --> 01:01:43.834
Not just a few things.

171
01:01:43.834 --> 01:01:48.834
But everything has been removed and forgiven.

172
01:01:49.834 --> 01:01:54.834
And what I want to teach today.

173
01:01:54.834 --> 01:01:57.834
Is the fact as a kind of reflection.

174
01:01:57.834 --> 01:02:00.834
Of what God has done in the past ten days.

175
01:02:00.834 --> 01:02:05.834
But also what I believe He will do for the rest of the year.

176
01:02:05.834 --> 01:02:10.834
For I do not believe that such a fixed time and a time of worship.

177
01:02:10.834 --> 01:02:14.834
Is a nice time to then conclude it.

178
01:02:14.834 --> 01:02:16.834
And then we will see further.

179
01:02:16.834 --> 01:02:18.834
God is always building further.

180
01:02:18.834 --> 01:02:20.834
Stone upon stone.

181
01:02:20.834 --> 01:02:23.834
He is a builder of human lives.

182
01:02:23.834 --> 01:02:25.834
And Jesus is the cornerstone.

183
01:02:26.834 --> 01:02:31.834
But what we have experienced in the past ten days.

184
01:02:31.834 --> 01:02:35.834
Is that He is doing a great work in many people.

185
01:02:35.834 --> 01:02:38.834
And Jesus does not want to leave anyone behind.

186
01:02:38.834 --> 01:02:41.834
He has you in His sights.

187
01:02:43.834 --> 01:02:45.834
He has you in His sights.

188
01:02:45.834 --> 01:02:49.834
And He loves you very much.

189
01:02:50.834 --> 01:02:53.834
He truly loves you very much.

190
01:02:55.834 --> 01:02:57.834
And He has you in His sights.

191
01:02:57.834 --> 01:03:01.834
I am now intentionally looking around into the eyes and faces of the people.

192
01:03:01.834 --> 01:03:04.834
And I am going from face to face.

193
01:03:04.834 --> 01:03:06.834
Hi Tine.

194
01:03:06.834 --> 01:03:08.834
I love you.

195
01:03:08.834 --> 01:03:10.834
Tine really let loose last week.

196
01:03:10.834 --> 01:03:14.834
And know Tine that your dance and your letting go for the Lord.

197
01:03:14.834 --> 01:03:16.834
Was not only good for yourself.

198
01:03:16.834 --> 01:03:19.834
But with those words and those prayers, you touch more people.

199
01:03:19.834 --> 01:03:21.834
Even the people who weren't even there.

200
01:03:21.834 --> 01:03:23.834
That is precisely intercession.

201
01:03:23.834 --> 01:03:25.834
We believe in prayer.

202
01:03:25.834 --> 01:03:27.834
And you can't be crazy enough.

203
01:03:27.834 --> 01:03:29.834
You went really crazy, I must say.

204
01:03:29.834 --> 01:03:31.834
I love it.

205
01:03:31.834 --> 01:03:33.834
Amen and amen.

206
01:03:33.834 --> 01:03:35.834
For He is the truth.

207
01:03:35.834 --> 01:03:38.834
But as I look through the halls.

208
01:03:38.834 --> 01:03:41.834
And then I look into all your beautiful faces.

209
01:03:41.834 --> 01:03:43.834
Some happy.

210
01:03:43.834 --> 01:03:45.834
Some joyful.

211
01:03:45.834 --> 01:03:47.834
Some joyful.

212
01:03:47.834 --> 01:03:49.834
And some tense.

213
01:03:49.834 --> 01:03:51.834
And some joyful.

214
01:03:51.834 --> 01:03:53.834
Even though the heart is tense.

215
01:03:53.834 --> 01:03:55.834
And some really joyful.

216
01:03:55.834 --> 01:03:57.834
Because they know who a Lord is.

217
01:03:57.834 --> 01:03:59.834
And they are already in that breakthrough.

218
01:03:59.834 --> 01:04:01.834
And some are already in that breakthrough.

219
01:04:01.834 --> 01:04:04.834
Some still need to come to that breakthrough.

220
01:04:04.834 --> 01:04:06.834
But here is the thing.

221
01:04:06.834 --> 01:04:09.834
As I am looking through the halls with my sight.

222
01:04:09.834 --> 01:04:13.834
God sees all of you at the same time.

223
01:04:13.834 --> 01:04:18.834
And He knows you one hundred percent.

224
01:04:18.834 --> 01:04:23.834
He knows you better than you know yourself.

225
01:04:23.834 --> 01:04:26.834
He knows what is going on in your heart.

226
01:04:26.834 --> 01:04:28.834
He also knows.

227
01:04:28.834 --> 01:04:30.834
For what we just read, I will explain to you in a moment.

228
01:04:30.834 --> 01:04:35.834
He also knows what is really going on.

229
01:04:35.834 --> 01:04:40.834
Often we think with our heads.

230
01:04:40.834 --> 01:04:43.834
To know what is happening.

231
01:04:43.834 --> 01:04:46.834
And we express that with our words.

232
01:04:46.834 --> 01:04:48.834
This is not fun.

233
01:04:48.834 --> 01:04:49.834
That is not going well.

234
01:04:49.834 --> 01:04:51.834
I feel this.

235
01:04:51.834 --> 01:04:53.834
So that must be there.

236
01:04:53.834 --> 01:04:59.834
But God knows what is truly going on deep in that heart.

237
01:04:59.834 --> 01:05:03.834
And that may have happened in your own life.

238
01:05:03.834 --> 01:05:06.834
It may even have happened in the ancestry.

239
01:05:06.834 --> 01:05:13.834
So that means what has happened in the past that does not even concern you yourself.

240
01:05:13.834 --> 01:05:19.834
Various concepts are at play that shape us in one way or another.

241
01:05:19.834 --> 01:05:24.834
And in the way we are formed, we will react.

242
01:05:24.834 --> 01:05:28.834
And God says, but I have a better plan.

243
01:05:28.834 --> 01:05:31.834
I want to make you whole.

244
01:05:31.834 --> 01:05:33.834
What we just read.

245
01:05:33.834 --> 01:05:37.834
I want to cleanse you in all areas.

246
01:05:37.834 --> 01:05:39.834
Do you hear what I am saying?

247
01:05:39.834 --> 01:05:41.834
In all areas.

248
01:05:41.834 --> 01:05:45.834
The angel who says to you, Zaja.

249
01:05:45.834 --> 01:05:51.834
Now I have cleansed your mouth and your heart.

250
01:05:51.834 --> 01:05:53.834
And I had to think about that in prayer.

251
01:05:53.834 --> 01:05:55.834
And I said okay, mouth and clean.

252
01:05:55.834 --> 01:05:57.834
Mouth and heart cleansed.

253
01:05:57.834 --> 01:06:00.834
And there is indeed a technique of writing and speaking in the Bible.

254
01:06:00.834 --> 01:06:03.834
That everything that comes first is important at that moment.

255
01:06:03.834 --> 01:06:06.834
First mouth, then heart.

256
01:06:06.834 --> 01:06:10.834
And I truly feel that God showed me the meaning of that.

257
01:06:10.834 --> 01:06:18.834
For some of us, it is first the intention that we must stop speaking the complaint and the lie ourselves.

258
01:06:18.834 --> 01:06:22.834
And then God goes further to cleanse our heart as well.

259
01:06:22.834 --> 01:06:25.834
But you know, your mouth is what you express.

260
01:06:25.834 --> 01:06:30.834
And we also know that out of the abundance of the heart, the mouth speaks.

261
01:06:30.834 --> 01:06:35.834
And we are so often trained to speak and speak and speak for ourselves.

262
01:06:35.834 --> 01:06:38.834
And there are all sorts of things we say.

263
01:06:38.834 --> 01:06:40.834
And very often it isn't even true.

264
01:06:40.834 --> 01:06:44.834
About what I think of myself or what I think I see around me.

265
01:06:44.834 --> 01:06:46.834
Or what I believe about myself.

266
01:06:46.834 --> 01:06:48.834
And I express it and I think it.

267
01:06:48.834 --> 01:06:51.834
And God says, Ssssst.

268
01:06:51.834 --> 01:06:53.834
Enough now.

269
01:06:53.834 --> 01:06:57.834
Be still and know that I am God.

270
01:06:57.834 --> 01:07:01.834
Silence is sometimes the very best.

271
01:07:01.834 --> 01:07:07.834
And then God can do a work in that silence to also cleanse your heart.

272
01:07:07.834 --> 01:07:11.834
And when God does it, He does it thoroughly.

273
01:07:11.834 --> 01:07:16.834
When God brings things to the surface, He does it thoroughly.

274
01:07:16.834 --> 01:07:20.834
Isaiah cries out in the presence of the Almighty.

275
01:07:20.834 --> 01:07:23.834
Help, I am doomed to die.

276
01:07:23.834 --> 01:07:26.834
And I, exactly what Ruben just said.

277
01:07:26.834 --> 01:07:31.834
Growing up in the church is a concept I just wrote down or wrote down this week for this sermon.

278
01:07:31.834 --> 01:07:39.834
I believe that this sermon resonates a lot with many people who have been in the faith for a long time.

279
01:07:39.834 --> 01:07:46.834
Because it is precisely these people who think they know God and have been walking with Him for a long time.

280
01:07:46.834 --> 01:07:49.834
And who have often raised their hands in worship.

281
01:07:49.834 --> 01:07:56.834
Even these people can end up in a state where you say, help, I just can't manage it.

282
01:07:56.834 --> 01:08:00.834
I can't manage this.

283
01:08:02.834 --> 01:08:06.834
We are not going to read the rest of Isaiah chapter success.

284
01:08:06.834 --> 01:08:13.834
At one point, the Lord says to Isaiah, Isaiah go on your way and bring this message.

285
01:08:13.834 --> 01:08:16.834
I have already spoken about it with several people.

286
01:08:16.834 --> 01:08:22.834
Because people then come to ask a question about what task Isaiah is given to do.

287
01:08:22.834 --> 01:08:25.834
Because in this it seems that God is harsh.

288
01:08:25.834 --> 01:08:30.834
That God sends Isaiah to tell the people, I am completely done with you.

289
01:08:30.834 --> 01:08:35.834
Like, I am going to make you stubborn and I am going to make you annoying.

290
01:08:35.834 --> 01:08:39.834
And I am going to make you so that I can punish you.

291
01:08:39.834 --> 01:08:42.834
This would point to a hard God.

292
01:08:42.834 --> 01:08:48.834
But what the prophet really means is that God says, you are stubborn.

293
01:08:48.834 --> 01:08:52.834
And from this stubbornness comes total destruction.

294
01:08:52.834 --> 01:08:58.834
You are doomed if you position yourself stubbornly towards God.

295
01:08:58.834 --> 01:09:02.834
And Isaiah receives this message to bring that.

296
01:09:02.834 --> 01:09:05.834
But from stubbornness comes even more stubbornness.

297
01:09:05.834 --> 01:09:09.834
And also for us as Christians, I just want to say.

298
01:09:09.834 --> 01:09:12.834
If we position ourselves stubbornly towards God.

299
01:09:12.834 --> 01:09:15.834
And this is very unpleasant about what I am going to say now.

300
01:09:15.834 --> 01:09:18.834
But I believe that Jesus wants to move forward with his church.

301
01:09:18.834 --> 01:09:21.834
I believe that He wants to purify His church.

302
01:09:21.834 --> 01:09:25.834
We have sung several times this week, purify us.

303
01:09:25.834 --> 01:09:27.834
Make us clean, make us holy.

304
01:09:27.834 --> 01:09:29.834
Make us holy again.

305
01:09:29.834 --> 01:09:33.834
And God does not settle for a church that is not holy.

306
01:09:33.834 --> 01:09:36.834
So I believe that when the church moves on.

307
01:09:36.834 --> 01:09:39.834
And some of us are left behind.

308
01:09:39.834 --> 01:09:41.834
And take a hard stance.

309
01:09:41.834 --> 01:09:44.834
In the end, you will face it.

310
01:09:44.834 --> 01:09:46.834
And these are not my words.

311
01:09:46.834 --> 01:09:48.834
But these are the words of Isaiah 6 as it says.

312
01:09:48.834 --> 01:09:52.834
For Isaiah says, and how long must I go on with this message?

313
01:09:52.834 --> 01:09:55.834
And then God says, until there is nothing left.

314
01:09:55.834 --> 01:09:57.834
These are hard words.

315
01:09:57.834 --> 01:10:00.834
But those hard words also apply to the church.

316
01:10:02.834 --> 01:10:04.834
I am included in that too.

317
01:10:04.834 --> 01:10:07.834
God has also done a work in me over the past 10 days.

318
01:10:07.834 --> 01:10:09.834
You are included in that too.

319
01:10:09.834 --> 01:10:12.834
For you and I are not different from each other.

320
01:10:12.834 --> 01:10:14.834
I am just an ordinary guy.

321
01:10:14.834 --> 01:10:16.834
And you are just an ordinary guy.

322
01:10:16.834 --> 01:10:18.834
Unless you are a woman.

323
01:10:18.834 --> 01:10:20.834
Right?

324
01:10:24.834 --> 01:10:26.834
Here I am, Lord.

325
01:10:26.834 --> 01:10:28.834
Send me.

326
01:10:28.834 --> 01:10:30.834
God says, who shall we send?

327
01:10:31.834 --> 01:10:35.834
And when you look at here I am, Lord, send me.

328
01:10:35.834 --> 01:10:38.834
Then you can place the emphasis on different words.

329
01:10:38.834 --> 01:10:41.834
And then you get a different kind of meaning.

330
01:10:42.834 --> 01:10:45.834
When God says, who shall we send?

331
01:10:45.834 --> 01:10:48.834
Then you fantasize.

332
01:10:48.834 --> 01:10:51.834
And then you visualize a group of people and angels.

333
01:10:51.834 --> 01:10:53.834
Actually just Isaiah.

334
01:10:53.834 --> 01:10:56.834
And angels with amazing appearances.

335
01:10:56.834 --> 01:10:58.834
With six wings.

336
01:10:58.834 --> 01:11:00.834
And wonderful creatures in heaven.

337
01:11:00.834 --> 01:11:02.834
Right?

338
01:11:02.834 --> 01:11:05.834
I think we will discover colors there that have not yet been imagined.

339
01:11:05.834 --> 01:11:07.834
I think we will smell scents there.

340
01:11:07.834 --> 01:11:09.834
That we still need to smell.

341
01:11:09.834 --> 01:11:12.834
I believe, hallelujah, that there are still dishes to be made.

342
01:11:12.834 --> 01:11:14.834
That we have never cooked before.

343
01:11:16.834 --> 01:11:19.834
You should especially say that now at the end of a fasting period.

344
01:11:19.834 --> 01:11:21.834
Lord, give me such a dish.

345
01:11:21.834 --> 01:11:23.834
As long as it contains chocolate.

346
01:11:26.834 --> 01:11:32.834
And then God says in the presence of the angels and the heavenly beings.

347
01:11:32.834 --> 01:11:34.834
God says, whom shall we send?

348
01:11:34.834 --> 01:11:39.834
And then you can emphasize the fact that Isaiah says, here I am Lord.

349
01:11:39.834 --> 01:11:41.834
Here, send me.

350
01:11:41.834 --> 01:11:45.834
And so the emphasis is on making yourself known.

351
01:11:45.834 --> 01:11:50.834
Here I am, I make myself available to be set apart.

352
01:11:50.834 --> 01:11:52.834
That is the emphasis on that.

353
01:11:52.834 --> 01:11:58.834
What I want to focus on today is the emphasis on I.

354
01:11:58.834 --> 01:12:00.834
Here I am.

355
01:12:01.834 --> 01:12:03.834
Here I am.

356
01:12:04.834 --> 01:12:06.834
Here I am Lord.

357
01:12:06.834 --> 01:12:12.834
Putting yourself in the spotlight in relation to the Most High who already sees you.

358
01:12:12.834 --> 01:12:14.834
He sees you already.

359
01:12:14.834 --> 01:12:16.834
He loves you already.

360
01:12:16.834 --> 01:12:18.834
He has already died for you on a cross.

361
01:12:18.834 --> 01:12:20.834
And He has already risen.

362
01:12:20.834 --> 01:12:22.834
Can I get an amen on that?

363
01:12:22.834 --> 01:12:24.834
He sees you already.

364
01:12:24.834 --> 01:12:27.834
But I want to encourage all of us in 2022.

365
01:12:27.834 --> 01:12:29.834
Emphasize that.

366
01:12:29.834 --> 01:12:31.834
Here I am, Lord.

367
01:12:31.834 --> 01:12:33.834
Or emphasize 'am'.

368
01:12:33.834 --> 01:12:35.834
Here I am now.

369
01:12:35.834 --> 01:12:37.834
Here I stand now, Lord.

370
01:12:37.834 --> 01:12:39.834
This is what is happening now, Lord.

371
01:12:39.834 --> 01:12:41.834
This is me, Lord.

372
01:12:41.834 --> 01:12:43.834
This is what has come of it now.

373
01:12:43.834 --> 01:12:44.834
Here I stand.

374
01:12:44.834 --> 01:12:45.834
Now, like this.

375
01:12:45.834 --> 01:12:46.834
Here.

376
01:12:47.834 --> 01:12:49.834
You can have me, Lord.

377
01:12:50.834 --> 01:12:54.834
This is in a state of which Isaiah says, I am doomed to die.

378
01:12:54.834 --> 01:12:56.834
This is not good.

379
01:12:56.834 --> 01:12:58.834
He says, but here I am.

380
01:13:00.834 --> 01:13:04.834
No beating around the bush.

381
01:13:04.834 --> 01:13:06.834
Do not present yourself as better than who you are.

382
01:13:06.834 --> 01:13:08.834
And that is why Ruben says this right now.

383
01:13:08.834 --> 01:13:09.834
And that is why I say this right now.

384
01:13:09.834 --> 01:13:13.834
Presenting yourself as better is very easy in the church.

385
01:13:13.834 --> 01:13:16.834
For the church has taught itself a number of things.

386
01:13:16.834 --> 01:13:17.834
As long as you just do this.

387
01:13:17.834 --> 01:13:18.834
And as long as you just do that.

388
01:13:18.834 --> 01:13:19.834
And as long as you give your tithe.

389
01:13:19.834 --> 01:13:20.834
And as long as you sing along.

390
01:13:20.834 --> 01:13:21.834
And as long as you come every Sunday.

391
01:13:21.834 --> 01:13:22.834
And as long as you participate in the children's work.

392
01:13:22.834 --> 01:13:25.834
And as long as you especially make coffee for me.

393
01:13:25.834 --> 01:13:27.834
Then everyone is happy.

394
01:13:27.834 --> 01:13:29.834
Then everyone is happy.

395
01:13:30.834 --> 01:13:32.834
And at the same time, you are withering away.

396
01:13:33.834 --> 01:13:37.834
People at home, if you are not here because of corona, I respect that.

397
01:13:37.834 --> 01:13:39.834
But if you are not here for whatever reason.

398
01:13:39.834 --> 01:13:42.834
Come back to the church in the name of Jesus.

399
01:13:42.834 --> 01:13:45.834
For you are withering away without Him.

400
01:13:46.834 --> 01:13:47.834
Here I am here.

401
01:13:48.834 --> 01:13:49.834
Here.

402
01:13:49.834 --> 01:13:50.834
Here I am here.

403
01:13:50.834 --> 01:13:52.834
It doesn't look good, but here I am.

404
01:13:56.834 --> 01:13:58.834
And I have written in big letters.

405
01:13:58.834 --> 01:14:02.834
Do not hide.

406
01:14:03.834 --> 01:14:06.834
Do not do it.

407
01:14:07.834 --> 01:14:10.834
Do not hide from the Lord.

408
01:14:10.834 --> 01:14:12.834
First of all, you won't succeed.

409
01:14:13.834 --> 01:14:15.834
And secondly, you will perish.

410
01:14:18.834 --> 01:14:21.834
In Genesis, the beginning of hiding is mentioned.

411
01:14:21.834 --> 01:14:24.834
In Genesis, it shows how things go wrong.

412
01:14:24.834 --> 01:14:27.834
But it also states what happens when you hide yourself.

413
01:14:27.834 --> 01:14:29.834
First of all, you will find God.

414
01:14:29.834 --> 01:14:31.834
And secondly, you have solved nothing.

415
01:14:33.834 --> 01:14:34.834
Genesis chapter 3.

416
01:14:35.834 --> 01:14:36.834
Just in case.

417
01:14:36.834 --> 01:14:38.834
I think the whole world knows this story.

418
01:14:39.834 --> 01:14:40.834
But we will read it anyway.

419
01:14:41.834 --> 01:14:43.834
Genesis chapter 3, verses 7 to 11.

420
01:14:43.834 --> 01:14:46.834
Then they saw, Adam and Eve have just sinned.

421
01:14:47.834 --> 01:14:49.834
Eve just has to eat from that fruit.

422
01:14:49.834 --> 01:14:51.834
And Adam is so weak to say no.

423
01:14:52.834 --> 01:14:54.834
It is really so quiet.

424
01:14:55.834 --> 01:15:00.834
Adam commits the sins of commission and omission.

425
01:15:01.834 --> 01:15:05.834
Commission and omission, participating or letting go.

426
01:15:06.834 --> 01:15:08.834
Letting the sins take their course.

427
01:15:08.834 --> 01:15:10.834
Adam should have been the priest of the family.

428
01:15:10.834 --> 01:15:12.834
And should have said, no this is not good.

429
01:15:12.834 --> 01:15:13.834
We are not going to do that.

430
01:15:14.834 --> 01:15:15.834
Stay away from that, woman.

431
01:15:17.834 --> 01:15:19.834
We will eat a passion fruit instead.

432
01:15:21.834 --> 01:15:22.834
Then they saw the truth.

433
01:15:22.834 --> 01:15:23.834
So they just sinned.

434
01:15:24.834 --> 01:15:25.834
Then they saw the truth.

435
01:15:26.834 --> 01:15:27.834
They saw that they were naked.

436
01:15:28.834 --> 01:15:31.834
Therefore, they made two loincloths from the leaves of the fig tree.

437
01:15:32.834 --> 01:15:34.834
So they had something to wear.

438
01:15:35.834 --> 01:15:36.834
They committed sins.

439
01:15:37.834 --> 01:15:42.834
And instead, they look for something to wear.

440
01:15:43.834 --> 01:15:44.834
Sin is inside.

441
01:15:45.834 --> 01:15:47.834
But they seek something from outside to put on.

442
01:15:48.834 --> 01:15:50.834
Makes no sense.

443
01:15:52.834 --> 01:15:54.834
Then they heard the voice of the Lord God.

444
01:15:54.834 --> 01:15:56.834
Who walked through the garden in the evening breeze.

445
01:15:56.834 --> 01:15:58.834
Lord, I want to walk with You.

446
01:15:58.834 --> 01:16:02.834
The man and his wife hurriedly hid from the Lord.

447
01:16:02.834 --> 01:16:04.834
They hid among the trees of the garden.

448
01:16:04.834 --> 01:16:07.834
But the Lord called to Adam and said.

449
01:16:07.834 --> 01:16:08.834
Where are you?

450
01:16:08.834 --> 01:16:09.834
And Adam answered.

451
01:16:09.834 --> 01:16:13.834
When I heard Your voice in the garden, I was afraid.

452
01:16:15.834 --> 01:16:16.834
I was afraid.

453
01:16:17.834 --> 01:16:19.834
This is the first.

454
01:16:20.834 --> 01:16:21.834
What I just said.

455
01:16:21.834 --> 01:16:23.834
If the Bible says something first.

456
01:16:23.834 --> 01:16:24.834
Then that, then that, then that.

457
01:16:25.834 --> 01:16:26.834
You need to pay attention.

458
01:16:26.834 --> 01:16:27.834
That first is very important.

459
01:16:28.834 --> 01:16:29.834
I was afraid.

460
01:16:31.834 --> 01:16:33.834
There is sin and it makes you afraid.

461
01:16:33.834 --> 01:16:34.834
For there is shame upon us.

462
01:16:35.834 --> 01:16:36.834
There is disgrace upon us.

463
01:16:37.834 --> 01:16:38.834
I became afraid.

464
01:16:38.834 --> 01:16:39.834
For I am naked.

465
01:16:39.834 --> 01:16:41.834
That is why I hid myself.

466
01:16:41.834 --> 01:16:42.834
The Lord said.

467
01:16:42.834 --> 01:16:44.834
Who told you that you are naked?

468
01:16:44.834 --> 01:16:47.834
Have you eaten from the tree of which I said,

469
01:16:47.834 --> 01:16:50.834
That you should not eat from it?

470
01:16:52.834 --> 01:16:55.834
The effect of Adam and Eve hiding themselves.

471
01:16:55.834 --> 01:16:59.834
Is the effect that continues in all of humanity.

472
01:16:59.834 --> 01:17:00.834
It always goes on.

473
01:17:00.834 --> 01:17:02.834
We all do it.

474
01:17:02.834 --> 01:17:03.834
We do it regularly.

475
01:17:03.834 --> 01:17:07.834
We hide the shames in our lives.

476
01:17:07.834 --> 01:17:09.834
For we want to have it all in order.

477
01:17:09.834 --> 01:17:11.834
We want to have it all in order.

478
01:17:11.834 --> 01:17:14.834
We all want to have a good opinion.

479
01:17:14.834 --> 01:17:15.834
And if we have a good opinion,

480
01:17:15.834 --> 01:17:17.834
Then you also want to write it.

481
01:17:17.834 --> 01:17:18.834
On social media.

482
01:17:18.834 --> 01:17:19.834
And everyone needs to hear it.

483
01:17:19.834 --> 01:17:21.834
But we want to have it for each other.

484
01:17:21.834 --> 01:17:22.834
We want to be healthy.

485
01:17:22.834 --> 01:17:23.834
We want to have enough money.

486
01:17:23.834 --> 01:17:26.834
And above all, we want to have a bit of esteem.

487
01:17:26.834 --> 01:17:30.834
And that's why we cover ourselves with fig leaves.

488
01:17:30.834 --> 01:17:31.834
What you just read.

489
01:17:31.834 --> 01:17:36.834
The fig leaf in the Bible represents prosperity.

490
01:17:36.834 --> 01:17:39.834
It shows that things are good.

491
01:17:39.834 --> 01:17:43.834
In multiple places in the Bible, you see the fig tree returning.

492
01:17:43.834 --> 01:17:47.834
And each time, the fig tree represents prosperity.

493
01:17:47.834 --> 01:17:48.834
Things are going well.

494
01:17:48.834 --> 01:17:49.834
Fertility.

495
01:17:49.834 --> 01:17:54.834
Unless that fig tree no longer has life.

496
01:17:54.834 --> 01:17:56.834
Then Jesus curses that fig tree.

497
01:17:56.834 --> 01:17:58.834
And says, you will never bear fruit again.

498
01:17:58.834 --> 01:17:59.834
Why?

